Z||000008||FieroJoe||04-23-2001||09:22 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Eric:<BR><B>That's great.  Everyone should restore a Fiero. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That's right!  I sure do have a better understanding of how a lot of systems work in that car, and a lot more appreciation to all the work that goes into them to design every little thing so it all works.<P><BR>Great job, you sure did make a very unique one there!  I was also thinking about that head unit, but decided on a Kameleon.  At first I thought I would regret it, because I really liked the sony one, but I'm glad I got it now!  I like the display a lot more than the sony one.<P>------------------<BR>AIM: Fiero87311<BR>87 Coupe 5sp. - big resto near completion!<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
