Z||000010||fierofreek2001||04-23-2001||10:59 PM||||hey guys , thanks for the kind words... just to answer the pace car question, when i originally started on the car, i was goin to do a full indy car, but then wasnt able to get the ground fx and front bumper i wanted and interior... so, i just figured, why not make a one of a kind!   the cool thing is that everyone around here has no clue its an UN official pace car!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> tee hee  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">    oh and the sony head unit is very nice, its 50w x 4 with sub controls, remote, and a black display panel on the other side, .. real nice at night time..     lets see what else... um.. heres a list of my mods just to show off  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>85 4 cyl 5 speed coupe<BR>- 88 coupe front fascia<BR>- 87 GT wing and Restored Stripped GT Rims <BR>- Pace Car Decals for doors and decklid<BR>- gm white paint job<BR>- blue halogen headlights<BR>- Dual exhaust with 3" tips<BR>- Sony Xplod Cd Player<BR>- 3" infiniti speakers<BR>- 340 watt pioneer amp<BR>- 10" rockford sub <BR>- Fiero store floormats<BR>- custom white dash trim and dash pocket<BR>- indy fiero horn button<BR>- reupholstered headliner and visors<BR>- short shifter<BR>- Mr Mikes leather seats with fiero logo and speaker holes<BR>- black carpeting<BR>- White intake w/ cold air <BR>- new plugs/wires/fuel filter<BR>- trunk cover<BR>... hm.. that about does it for now<BR>oh by the way, my passengers dont seem to mind the sub .. i dont know why .. so oh well!<BR>ok well ill cya all at carlisle!  <BR>steve||||reg||1
