Z||000013||sqoach||04-24-2001||12:16 PM||||I don't think I can make it to any car shows this year that are very far away. The only one I'm planning on going to is the one down in Norman, OK because it's not very far from me.<P>My box does sound really good though. It can hit some really low notes. It makes my rearview mirror shake. The sub I'm using is a really good one, though. 250 watts RMS. 31-150 Hz.<BR>I'm not sure how the sub you have would sound in this box. Is it the original 200 watts Rockford Punch?||||reg||1
